WEBVTT
NOTE Think Outside the Chat™ · W3 · EN · Director-approved narration (2026-10-27) · captions from narration audio

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.180
Let's begin by defining your AI intent
gap.

2
00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:07.220
This is simply the distance between what
you expect to achieve with artificial

3
00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:10.180
intelligence and the results you are
actually seeing today.

4
00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:14.480
To establish your baseline, please
complete the four inputs provided on

5
00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:17.480
screen. Use your recent experience as a
general guide.

6
00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:20.600
We are looking for estimates, not perfect
data points.

7
00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:23.940
Next, identify the friction points in your
workflow.

8
00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:27.560
Focus on time loss to repetition, manual
adjustments,

9
00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:29.200
or correcting AI outputs.

10
00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.240
And be sure to track these separately from
your total usage time.

11
00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:34.860
Finally, review your four answers.

12
00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:38.200
These are a reference point to help us
measure your progress later,

13
00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:39.720
rather than a formal grade.

14
00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:41.660
You are now prepared to move forward.
